## Sprint feedback

At the end of each sprint, run an after-action review and file each gap with the [sprint-feedback form](https://github.com/CUPIDS-Lab/data-skills/issues/new?template=sprint-feedback.yml) against the section numbers above. Private projects report process lessons only.
